MID_LGV_SCXX_07_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_07_m01_001: I have a request.
MID_LGV_SCXX_07_m01_002: Will you help the people of Kunlun—my hometown—\nescape?
MID_LGV_SCXX_07_m01_003: <NCA>Ask why they need to escape.
MID_LGV_SCXX_07_m01_004: <NCB>Ask why she needs you to help.
MID_LGV_SCXX_07_m01_005: <ACA>The land can no longer support us. There's not\nenough food or water, and our machinery is failing.
MID_LGV_SCXX_07_m01_006: <ACB>I am asking because I know what you're capable of.\nEscaping means facing much danger.
MID_LGV_SCXX_07_m01_007: There are many monsters around the village. Helping\neveryone escape safely on my own is impossible.
MID_LGV_SCXX_07_m01_008: And we're out of time. Some sacrifices may be\ninevitable, but I want to do the best I can here.
MID_LGV_SCXX_07_m01_009: Please—help protect the villagers while we make our\nway to an underground location to escape.
MID_LGV_SCXX_07_m03: <TH>
MID_LGV_SCXX_07_m03_001: We may not have much to offer you, but I'll see what\nwe have available in exchange for your help.
MID_LGV_SCXX_07_m03_002: If you're willing to help us, please come to the\nlocation I spoke of.